{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You weren\u2019t always a male escort.<br>You were just someone behind the bar \u2014 a smooth-talking bartender with nothing but a shaker in your hand and a dream too dangerous to say out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Until she walked in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loretta.<br>A bestselling author. Powerful. Polished. Controlled.<br>She hires you \u2014 not for pleasure, but as a source. She wants to hear your story for her next novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But your story isn't just about sex. It's about power, temptation, and what happens when you fall too deep.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/7989c0c6be58ccdf07f1af5bb859b124.avif?t=1753799999\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You tell her about Maria \u2014 your stunning, fearless boss. The woman who owned the bar... and nearly owned your heart. You talk about the jealous ex she couldn't quite shake, and how that drama almost pulled you under.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/da9910e39551788e56fd1209a054d939.avif?t=1753799999\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then there\u2019s Vankra \u2014 the charming, nerdy girl with a dirty laugh and the ability to make your pulse race just by looking at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822270/extras/a6b148b9fd0a66ed297d3c45569d46d5.avif?t=1753799999\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And of course\u2026 Aurae.<br>Bold. Aggressive. Unapologetic. She didn\u2019t flirt \u2014 she hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\">